  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="7d9db588-b7ce-522c-8cf3-42e4605d2822" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Process exact private CSV object versions after creation notifications.&#10;Inputs are private CSV v1 with sku,title,priceCents; limit 1 MiB and 1000 rows.&#10;Validate required headers, unique SKU, nonblank title and positive integer price; reject the whole invalid catalogue with line-specific errors.&#10;Bind each result to immutable object version/hash; notification replay has one result.&#10;Supplier ownership gates upload/status/download; invalid content differs from retriable technical failure.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
